<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<office:document xmlns:office="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:office:1.0" xmlns:text="urn:oasis:names:tc:opendocument:xmlns:text:1.0" office:version="1.3" office:mimetype="application/vnd.oasis.opendocument.text"><office:body><office:text>
  <text:h text:outline-level="1">Notice of Circumstance Under POL-CLM-8821</text:h>
  <text:p>Recipient: claims@ironclad-risk.example</text:p>
  <text:p>Matter: RISK-2026-228; Incident: INC-2026-905.</text:p>
  <text:p>On September 5, 2026, an employee fell from a loading platform and alleged a fractured arm that may require surgery.</text:p>
  <text:p>Potential claims include bodily injury, treatment costs, lost wages, and defense costs. The current preliminary estimate is USD 3,200 and is not a waiver of notice.</text:p>
</office:text></office:body></office:document>
